---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
---

<InfoLayout 
  title="About Us — Y2mate YouTube Downloader & MP3 Converter" 
  description="Learn more about Y2mate, the premier ad-free and secure online YouTube video downloader and high-fidelity MP3/MP4 conversion service."
>
  <div class="content-article">
    <span class="caption-mono section-eyebrow">Company Profile</span>
    <h1 class="display-lg">About Y2mate</h1>
    
    <p class="lead-text">
      Welcome to Y2mate, the leading provider of premium media conversion and downloading services. Our platform enables users worldwide to convert and download their favorite YouTube videos directly into high-fidelity MP3 audio or MP4 video files, running completely inside their web browser.
    </p>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <section class="info-section">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>
        At Y2mate, our mission is to build the fastest, most reliable, and security-first downloader for digital media. We believe that access to educational tutorials, high-definition visual content, and soundtracks should be simple, efficient, and free from invasive marketing tricks.
      </p>
      <p>
        Traditional online video converters are often packed with malicious ads, intrusive pop-ups, and redirection loops. We designed Y2mate to be a premium, completely ad-free alternative. We prioritize user privacy, data security, and responsive performance above all else.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="info-section">
      <h2>Core Advantages</h2>
      <div class="advantage-grid">
        <div class="advantage-item">
          <h3>No Registration or Installation</h3>
          <p>Everything runs natively in your browser. There is no need to register accounts, provide email addresses, or download suspicious extensions or software.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="advantage-item">
          <h3>Sleek & Ad-Free Design</h3>
          <p>We provide a high-end, uncluttered layout with zero popups or malicious redirects, ensuring a safe downloading experience.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="advantage-item">
          <h3>High Quality Formats</h3>
          <p>From crystal-clear 320kbps MP3 audio streams to full-resolution 1080p, 1440p, or 4K MP4 videos, our muxing engine delivers premium files.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="advantage-item">
          <h3>Dynamic Stream Scanning</h3>
          <p>We analyze YouTube media streams dynamically for each request to ensure maximum availability and prevent conversion failures.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="info-section">
      <h2>How We Operate</h2>
      <p>
        Our backend leverages advanced stream extraction pipelines that dynamically scan video formats and separate audio/video chunks directly from source streams. If a user selects a high-definition video format (such as 1080p or 4K) which YouTube stores separately, our system merges (muxes) the streams back together automatically in the background before serving the final high-definition MP4.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</InfoLayout>

<style>
  .content-article {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .section-eyebrow {
    color: var(--violet);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xxs);
  }
  .display-lg {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 44px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text-ink);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .lead-text {
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 28px;
    color: var(--text-body);
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .divider {
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--hairline);
    margin: var(--space-md) 0;
  }
  .info-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  .info-section h2 {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xxs);
  }
  .info-section p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 24px;
    color: var(--text-body);
  }
  .advantage-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    margin-top: var(--space-xs);
  }
  .advantage-item {
    background: var(--canvas-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xxs);
  }
  .advantage-item h3 {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-ink);
  }
  .advantage-item p {
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 20px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .advantage-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-md);
    }
    .display-lg {
      font-size: 28px;
      line-height: 34px;
    }
  }
</style>
